      "exact_current": false,
      "source_delta": "--- currentADL\n+++ owner\n@@ -3,31 +3,43 @@\n Canonical command:\n \n ```bash\n-bash adl/tools/demo_v0891_five_agent_hey_jude.sh\n+ADL_DEMO_ADL_BIN=/path/to/adl-runtime bash adl/tools/demo_v0891_five_agent_hey_jude.sh /fresh/output/path\n ```\n+\n+The executable must already exist; this entrypoint never builds or downloads a\n+binary. With no override it checks `.adl/bin/adl-runtime`. Output must be a new\n+path; existing data is preserved. All five named roles use a local fixture\n+server, including the model-named roles. No paid inference, live residents or\n+physical MIDI are involved. `verification.json` pins the executable and run/trace\n+artifacts; `fixture_cleanup.json` records owned-server shutdown.\n+\n+This is the retained source route `RD08-source-021`. An installed package demo\n+contract is still pending; executing this source wrapper against a supplied\n+binary does not by itself qualify installed dependency packaging. See\n+[dependency closure](../../docs/qualification/RETAINED_DEMO_DEPENDENCIES.md).\n \n ## What It Does\n \n This `v0.89.1` flagship demo turns the earlier multi-provider groundwork into a\n-five-participant performance packet:\n+five-role simulated performance packet:\n \n-- Layer 8 as the human bandleader\n+- Layer 8 as the simulated bandleader\n - ChatGPT\n - Claude\n - Gemini\n - DeepSeek\n \n The package stays transcript-first and bounded. It uses section cues instead of\n-a tracked lyric sheet, and it records one real MIDI cue layer through a small\n-profile-driven bridge surface.\n+a tracked lyric sheet, and it converts a separate MIDI fixture through a small\n+profile-driven bridge. The workflow does not consume the resulting cues.\n \n ## Why It Matters\n \n-This demo proves something more memorable than another review packet:\n+This bounded demo checks:\n \n-- one human and four provider voices can coordinate on one ADL runtime\n-- the cue layer is visible rather than hand-waved\n-- the performance can be warm and strange without becoming structurally vague\n+- ten successful fixture turns across five named roles on Runtime\n+- exact run and trace correspondence with retained output artifacts\n+- independent MIDI fixture conversion and owned fixture-server cleanup\n \n ## Primary Proof Surfaces\n \n"
    },
